Spartronics Team 4915 on Saturday, March 9 and Sunday, March 10 will be at Auburn Mountainview High School for its first of two District event competitions for the 2019 Competition Season! Drive down to cheer on robot CHAOS - or watch live on Twitch! Two streams are set up to broadcast all the action from the live streaming online video service, Twitch: Mar 8-10: Auburn Mountainview Multi Camera stream: [http://twitch.tv/firstwa\_red1](http://twitch.tv/firstwa_red1) Full Field stream: [http://twitch.tv/firstwa\_red2](http://twitch.tv/firstwa_red2) ![Spartronics Pit at Auburn MVWHS](../../assets/posts/live-stream-watch-spartronics-from-auburn-mtview-high-compete-live/SpartronicsPit.jpg)

Spartronics Pit - where the robot lives during the competition - at Auburn Mt View HS

We will be posting updates our Match Schedule -- and final Match scores -- on [Twitter](https://twitter.com/spartronics4915) and [Facebook](https://www.facebook.com/spartronics4915/) as soon as they become available. GO SPARTRONICS!!!
